    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061123.0341\n\nTOKYO, Nov. 24 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nTokyo stocks open lower\n\n\n\n\nTokyo stocks opened lower Friday as exporters lost ground on a stronger yen.\n\nIn the first 15 minutes of trading, the 225-issue Nikkei Stock Average lost 152.68 points, or 0.96 percent, to 15,761.55.\n\nThe broader Tokyo Stock Price Index of all First Section issues on the Tokyo Stock Exchange was down 13.22 points, or 0.85 percent, to 1,539.65. The Second Section fell.",
